{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13658","headline":"赠别刘长卿时赴河南严中丞幕府 · 严维","name":"赠别刘长卿时赴河南严中丞幕府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"早见登郎署，同时迹下僚。\n几年江路永，今去国门遥。\n文变骚人体，官移汉帝朝。\n望山吟度日，接枕话通宵。\n万里趋公府，孤帆恨信潮。\n匡时知已老，圣代耻逃尧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"严维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13658.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13658","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}